+
+Optional authority result context: supply both `getResultContext()` and
+`validateResultContext(context)` on both clients. Only authority capture runs,
+for selections and timeouts. It must return permitted JSON; capture/validation
+errors fail with `result_context_failed` without inventing a timeout. Received
+context is validated and immutable with the result. Use observations rather than
+claims about unseen actions. No context field is added when callbacks are absent.
